      ],
      "text": "Role in ADHD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " α2 agonists (clonidine, guanfacine) are sometimes used when stimulants are ineffective or cause unacceptable AEs; less effective, not first-line; sometimes combined w stimulants; monitor closely for AEs."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
